+ Attempt *all forty* questions in *forty minutes*. There is no negative marking, so never leave a blank.

+ A question a minute. If a question takes longer than ninety seconds, flag it and come back in the final pass.

+ Mark yourself against the key only when the forty minutes have elapsed.

+ Record every miss in the Question Map. It turns a score into a revision plan.

